If y ou haven’ t already , watch  « online to study how the
¡’ s contr asting qualities of content, length, and pace help channel
the actors’ performances.
In life, emotions seem to sur ge ± belly ā spread through
the body . For this reason, acting  coaches teach their students to think, not in
their hea ds, but  ¢ir guts. Bad actors tend to be self-puppeteers who
work ± head down to pull their own strings; fine actors  let ¶
