dramatizes it.
I think the best approach to creating inner ¡ is simply this: T reat
your ¥  mind ń setting, a world populated wit h a cast of
characters calle d selves. Let the mindscape sprawl ń cityscape,
landscape, or battleground, a mental mise-en-scène · staging of a
story . Then move into that world yourself and take up residence ¢
®’ s center of consciou sness. From this ơ view , create inner
