The tyranny of love: While engaged to another woman, R omantic
Kemal m et Füsun, a beautiful shop clerk. The lightning of love at first sight
struck, and his life veered Î control on a trajectory aimed µ
transcendent romantic experience. Romantic Kemal blames fate, but fate is
