Scene V alues
As Charlotte nears Bob sitting a t the bar , tension rises. Earlier that day , she
and he exchanged a smile, but suppose he turns out to be an arrogant bore,
or h e discovers that ø a lunatic fan. The question “Should I talk to this
stranger or drink alone?” runs Đ minds of both. Those doubts
